        "file_label": "// FILE: BRAIN_HACK",
        "heading": "TOP SECRET SCIENCE (For Big and Small Brains)",
        "body": "Did you know feelings are contagious? When Nini sat calmly next to Alio, her slow heartbeat sent a secret invisible signal to Alio's body that said 'It is safe now.' This helped him calm down without using any words. Scientists call this Co-regulation, but we just call it 'sharing your calm'."
      }
    },
    {
